# RG Fightclub – Project Structure

Reference for the directory layout and key files in this Next.js portfolio project.

## Directory Structure

```
RG Fightclub/
├── app/                          # Next.js App Router
│   ├── (frontend)/               # Site public
│   │   ├── globals.css           # Global styles, Tailwind, AOS, Swiper
│   │   ├── layout.tsx            # Root layout, fonts, metadata
│   │   ├── page.tsx              # Home page (composes all sections)
│   │   ├── robots.ts
│   │   └── sitemap.ts
│   └── (payload)/                # Payload CMS (admin + API)
│       ├── admin/[[...segments]]/
│       └── api/
├── collections/                  # Payload collections (Users, Media)
├── payload.config.ts             # Payload CMS configuration
│
├── components/                   # React components
│   ├── Header.tsx                # Sticky nav, scroll behavior
│   ├── Hero.tsx                  # Hero section with background
│   ├── Presentation.tsx         # About section
│   ├── Projects.tsx             # Projects tabs
│   ├── Gallery.tsx              # Image gallery grid
│   ├── Testimonials.tsx         # Swiper testimonials slider
│   └── Footer.tsx               # Footer with links & contact
│
├── types/                        # TypeScript definitions
│   └── index.ts                 # Project, Testimonial, GalleryImage
│
├── public/                       # Static assets (served at /)
│   ├── images/                   # Site images
│   │   ├── rgfightclub_hero.png
│   │   ├── rgfightclub_logo_black.svg
│   │   ├── rgfightclub_logo_white.svg
│   │   ├── rgfightclub_presentation.png
│   │   ├── rgfightclub_testimonial.png
│   │   └── ...
│   ├── file.svg
│   ├── vercel.svg
│   └── window.svg
│
├── .cursor/
│   └── rules/                    # Cursor rules
│       ├── cursor-rules.mdc
│       ├── project-structure.mdc
│       └── self-improvement.mdc
│
├── .gitignore
├── eslint.config.mjs
├── next.config.ts
├── package.json
├── package-lock.json
├── postcss.config.mjs
├── tsconfig.json
│
└── Documentation (project root)
    ├── README.md
    ├── PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md
    ├── CUSTOMIZATION.md
    ├── DEPLOYMENT.md
    ├── FEATURES.md
    ├── GETTING_STARTED.md
    ├── QUICKSTART.md
    ├── RESOURCES.md
    ├── SEO.md
    └── TODO.md
```

## Important Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `app/page.tsx` | Main page; imports and renders all sections |
| `app/layout.tsx` | Root layout, fonts, metadata |
| `app/globals.css` | Tailwind, AOS, Swiper, custom variables |
| `types/index.ts` | Shared types (Project, Testimonial, GalleryImage) |
| `next.config.ts` | Next.js config (images, etc.) |
| `package.json` | Dependencies, scripts (dev, build, start, lint) |

## Component Flow

```
page.tsx
  ├── Header
  ├── Hero
  ├── Presentation
  ├── Projects
  ├── Gallery
  ├── Testimonials
  └── Footer
```

## Conventions

- **Components**: PascalCase (`Header.tsx`, `Hero.tsx`)
- **Imports**: Use `@/` alias for project paths
- **Images**: Place in `public/images/`, reference as `/images/...`
- **New rules**: Add under `.cursor/rules/` with `.mdc` extension
